{%- comment -%}
  Figma: Components Atoms / Review card (Layout Desktop | Mobile is responsive: Manjula: a 120px meta column, 24px apart (260px from lg) beside the content, top border, 32px above and below (24/60px from lg).
  Mobile: the stars sit under the author (meta), the body is clamped to 6 lines with a Read more link when it is longer
  loading   boolean, renders the skeleton (data-loading on the text slots; the list swaps these for real cards)
  JS: reviews__ui.js clones this from <template data-reviews-card> and fills the data-reviews-* slots. Hidden slots stay hidden until filled.
  Shows Recommend (icon-text sm), Answers (attribute xs), Stars (star icons, JS sets data-empty per star), Media (review media thumbnails) and Reply (left border) when present. No helpful votes (Hendrik, 21 Nov).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture stars -%}
  {%- for i in (1..5) -%}
    <span class="size-3 shrink-0 data-[empty]:text-rating-empty [&>svg]:size-full" data-reviews-star>{{ 'icon__star.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</span>
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- liquid
  assign skeleton = 'data-[loading]:rounded-xs data-[loading]:bg-surface-alt data-[loading]:text-transparent data-[loading]:animate-pulse'
-%}
<article class="review-card grid grid-cols-[calc(var(--spacing)*30)_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-6 border-t border-border py-8 lg:grid-cols-[calc(var(--spacing)*65)_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-x-0 lg:pt-6 lg:pb-15" data-reviews-card{% if loading %} data-loading aria-hidden="true"{% endif %}>
  <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-4" data-reviews-meta>
    <p class="text-label-base text-text {{ skeleton }} data-[loading]:h-4 data-[loading]:w-32" data-reviews-author{% if loading %} data-loading{% endif %}></p>
    <div class="inline-flex text-rating data-[loading]:text-surface-alt lg:hidden" data-reviews-stars{% if loading %} data-loading{% endif %} role="img">{{ stars }}</div>
    <p class="flex items-center gap-2 text-body-sm text-text" data-reviews-recommend hidden>
      <span class="size-4 shrink-0 text-text [&>svg]:size-full" aria-hidden="true">{{ 'icon__check.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</span>
      <span data-reviews-recommend-text></span>
    </p>
    <dl class="flex flex-col gap-2 lg:gap-1" data-reviews-answers hidden></dl>
  </div>

  <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-6" data-reviews-content>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2" data-reviews-head>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between lg:gap-6">
        <h3 class="text-heading-6 text-text {{ skeleton }} data-[loading]:h-4 data-[loading]:w-48" data-reviews-title{% if loading %} data-loading{% endif %}></h3>
        <time class="shrink-0 text-body-xs text-text-muted {{ skeleton }} data-[loading]:h-3.5 data-[loading]:w-20" data-reviews-date{% if loading %} data-loading{% endif %}></time>
      </div>
      <div class="inline-flex text-rating data-[loading]:text-surface-alt max-lg:hidden" data-reviews-stars{% if loading %} data-loading{% endif %} role="img">{{ stars }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-6">
      <div class="w-full text-body-sm text-text [&_p+p]:mt-3 max-lg:line-clamp-6 max-lg:data-[expanded]:line-clamp-none {{ skeleton }} data-[loading]:h-16 data-[loading]:w-full" data-reviews-body{% if loading %} data-loading{% endif %}></div>
      {%- assign read_more = 'reviews.read_more' | t -%}
      {% render 'link', label: read_more, size: 'sm', class: 'lg:hidden', attributes: 'data-reviews-read-more hidden aria-expanded="false"' %}
    </div>
    <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-1" data-reviews-media hidden role="list"></ul>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-l border-text pl-4" data-reviews-reply hidden>
      <p class="text-label-base text-text" data-reviews-reply-author></p>
      <div class="text-body-sm text-text [&_p+p]:mt-3" data-reviews-reply-body></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
